@startuml M6-Pipeline-Activity

' Complete end-to-end pipeline activity: load seeds -> CRAWL phase -> INDEX phase -> SEARCH phase -> display results
' Three phases run sequentially with checkpoints: Phase 1 downloads READMEs via MapReduce and GitHub API
' Phase 2 builds inverted index: extract terms, calculate TF/DF/IDF, generate n-grams, compute PageRank iteratively
' Phase 3 handles queries: parse -> process -> lookup postings -> calculate scores (TF-IDF + metadata) -> rank -> display

!define BGCOLOR #F5F5F5
skinparam backgroundColor BGCOLOR
skinparam activityBorderColor #333
skinparam arrowColor #333
skinparam startBorderColor #333
skinparam endBorderColor #333
skinparam shadowing false

title M6 Distributed Search Engine - End-to-End Pipeline

start

:Load seed file
(owner/repo pairs);

:Initialize crawler
frontier and seen repos;

partition "Phase 1: CRAWL (Download READMEs)" {
  :Distribute repos to nodes
  via MapReduce;
  
  repeat
    :Fetch repo metadata
    from GitHub API;
    :Download README file;
    :Store in KV store;
    :Mark as seen;
  repeat while (More repos?)
  
  :Log: crawl complete
  URLs downloaded, size;
}

:Checkpoint: Crawl persisted;

partition "Phase 2: INDEX (Build Index)" {
  :Load all documents
  from KV store;
  
  :Job 1: Extract Terms;
  note right
    Map: normalize + tokenize
    Shuffle: group by term  
    Reduce: collect doc IDs
  end note
  
  :Store posting lists;
  
  :Job 2: Calculate Statistics;
  note right
    Map: emit (term, tf, doc_len)
    Shuffle: partition by term
    Reduce: calc DF and TF
  end note
  
  :Store TF/DF data;
  
  :Generate N-grams
  (1-grams, 2-grams, 3-grams);
  
  :Job 3: PageRank (Iterative);
  note right
    Init: PR(d) = 1/N
    Iterate MapReduce until converged
    Map: emit PR contributions
    Reduce: sum PR values
  end note
  
  :Store PageRank scores;
  
  :Log: index complete
  size, term count;
}

:Checkpoint: Index built;

partition "Phase 3: SEARCH (Query & Rank)" {
  :Wait for user query;
  
  :Parse query
  (extract terms, filters);
  
  :Process query
  (tokenize, stem, normalize);
  
  :Lookup posting lists
  in KV store;
  
  repeat
    :Fetch TF and DF values;
    :Calculate TF-IDF score;
    
    :Fetch doc metadata
    (stars, language, topics);
    :Apply metadata boost;
    
    :Combine scores
    (0.75*TF-IDF + 0.25*boost);
  repeat while (More candidates?)
  
  :Rank results
  by final score;
  
  :Apply filters
  (language, owner);
  
  :Return top K results
  (K=10);
}

:Format results
(CLI/JSON/CSV);

:Display to user;

stop

note right
  Persistence Points:
  - Frontier after crawl
  - All index data in KV store
  - Can resume from checkpoints
  
  Distributed Execution:
  - MapReduce spreads work
  - Gossip coordinates nodes
  - KV store sharded by key
end note

@enduml
